f the United States Code.\n\nLYNDON B. JOHNSON\n\nThe White House\n\nMay 27, 1966\n","path":"jobs/app-executive-orders/output/texts/executive-order-11284-suspension-the-provisions-sections-5701a1-and-6371-title-10-united.txt","sha256":"1dca8cc43b6e39c56e292631249c23e9e02fdec44fc2b252c8ccc26586b62b7c","source":{"line":1306,"path":"jobs/app-transcriptions/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"937da3eab389ab07b70576c67c4853e20058510a9cbd92b08379fc576ecf5733"}},{"first_1500_characters":"Executive Order 11284\nSUSPENSION OF THE PROVISIONS OF SECTIONS 5701(a)(1) AND 6371  \nOF TITLE 10, UNITED STATES CODE, WHICH RELATE TO THE CON­\nTINUATION ON THE ACTIVE LIST OF REAR ADMIRALS IN THE LINE  \nOF THE NAVY NOT RESTRICTED IN THE PERFORMANCE OF DUTY\nBy virtue of the authority vested in me by Sections 5711(b) and  \n6386(c) of Title 10 of the United States Code, I hereby suspend the  \nprovisions of Sections 5701(a) (1) and 6371 of Title 10 of the United  \nStates Code.\nL yndon  B. J ohnson\nT he  W h ite H ouse,\nM ay 27,1966.\n[F.R. Doc. 66-6017; Filed, May 27, 1966; 11:41 a.m.]","path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/texts/cd-job-fr-originals-11284-b2828a3a8b.txt","sha256":"623be9501704d6115f5d2cf369c7adc14f24b41f736791cdb30e2bd31966f62e","source":{"line":6682,"path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"86e8d4ab70fb7aaa935f613db834a12201874ffff95c7b62c1064453324de59c"}},{"first_1500_characters":"Instrument: EO:11284\nSource: https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1966-05-28/pdf/FR-1966-05-28.pdf\nSHA-256 of the downloaded file: b2828a3a8bc493cada9ccdd8a5c0d4bf94bd19335c2f6823e5d3a23b567f4523\nLocation: 31 FR 7669, PDF pages 13-13 (confidence high)\nMachine-extracted text layer of the official PDF (OCR for 1936-1994 scans). May contain recognition errors and parts of neighbouring documents on the same pages. Not an authenticated transcription: check the PDF pages.\n\n=== PDF page 13 of 72 ===\nTHE PRESIDENT 7669\nExecutive Order 11284\nSUSPENSION OF THE PROVISIONS OF SECTIONS 5701(a)(1) AND 6371  \nOF TITLE 10, UNITED STATES CODE, WHICH RELATE TO THE CON­\nTINUATION ON THE ACTIVE LIST OF REAR ADMIRALS IN THE LINE  \nOF THE NAVY NOT RESTRICTED IN THE PERFORMANCE OF DUTY\nBy virtue of the authority vested in me by Sections 5711(b) and  \n6386(c) of Title 10 of the United States Code, I hereby suspend the  \nprovisions of Sections 5701(a) (1) and 6371 of Title 10 of the United  \nStates Code.\nL yndon  B. J ohnson\nT he  W h ite H ouse,\nM ay 27,1966.\n[F.R. Doc. 66-6017; Filed, May 27, 1966; 11:41 a.m.]\nFEDERAL REGISTER, VOL. 31, NO. 104— SATURDAY, MAY 28, 1966\n","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_11284.txt","sha256":"1ce36ac80346a82cd0fc8270da8a35ee2aff1745a1e357c18c7750a79dd98d5b","source":{"line":1177,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"77bcb670fae16a7026f2b5e53184222e9f88f528765a52436045ef3aaca44a0e"}}]}
